{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/480880-durances-alien-changelings","id":480880,"title":"Durances: Alien Changelings?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-14T16:37:42-07:00","id":480880,"title":"Durances: Alien Changelings?","content":"So I've been given some thought about the Beast seeming and have come to wonder if it is possible for there to be Kiths based on alien lifeforms. The inspiration for this idea came from the Sid Meier's game Beyond Earth. The game's premise revolves around humans landing on a new world and they develop their society in one of three different biological philosophies. Purity is for those who wish to retain their humanity and is heavily focused on spirituality, Supremacy is for those who wish to augment their bodies with machinery and is about conquering the planet, and then there is Harmony, who wish to modify their bodies with controlled mutations so they can adapt to the planet's ecosystem.<br /> <br /> This involves them becoming alien hybrids in the process, and even being able to tame and control the indigenous population.<br /> <br /> <br /> Problem is that unlike natural and mythical creatures, I don't really know what kind of abilities Changelings based on aliens might possess, or what manner of Kiths to create for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T16:40:42-07:00","id":480900,"title":"","content":"Second Edition sounds like it should be able to handle things like this more easily, considering how it sounds like Kiths will be more general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T16:41:13-07:00","id":480902,"title":"","content":"I had an Ogre who had been abducted by aliens and had muscle surgically implanted into him. <br /> <br /> It's all about changing the flavor while keeping the same rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T16:46:47-07:00","id":480923,"title":"","content":"I have had 3 NPC Changelings based on Grey Aliens in MDH. This what what I had for them<br /> <br /> Andromeda Spring Court Wizened Chirurgen/Inventor<br /> Haily Summer Court Wizened Inventor/Gremlin<br /> Mr. Grey Winter Court Wizened Chirurgen<br /> <br /> Their Keeper, The Mothership, has become a major antagonist, as an item, The Table, used by her Changelings to turn kidnapped humans into Greys, was taken by Andromeda when she escaped (she was actually pursuing Haily, who tricked her into thinking she was in love with her to escape). Andromeda went native, and the Table was stolen by the Winter King used to aggressively turn captured Loyalists into Manniken minions by Mr. Grey, and now that the PCs have found out, all matter of stuff is happening which may result in a Mothership sponsored invasion if the bulk of the Winter Court is implicated in the crime. The Table is, in fact, a Prop with it's own agenda.<br /> <br /> Hope this helps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T05:39:00-07:00","id":481280,"title":"","content":"The abilities of the various beast kiths are very generic and can easily apply to any alien from any SF book out there. Of course, the animal based contract might not work as well, but you are not forced to pick those contracts or simply assume that an insect-like alien can use the contract with insects <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4560-madfox11","name":"Madfox11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T07:03:00-07:00","id":481294,"title":"","content":"Maybe you bother to much about your Alien-kith, just go with the nearest concept : a bug-like Alien ? <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Skitterskulk. A fish-like with a spacesuit fill with water ? Swimmerskin. A light-being ? Bright Ones or Fireheart. A gray alien ? Some darkling ou wizened kith can do the trick. And so on... ^^</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3883-arabidopsis","name":"Arabidopsis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T09:53:26-07:00","id":481381,"title":"","content":"I once came up with a concept for a Wizened Soldier inspired by Zen: Intergalactic Ninja.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T11:05:00-07:00","id":482585,"title":"","content":"One thing to keep in mind is that when Changeling meets scifi, it's the softest scifi imaginable if you want to keep the spirit of the setting. &quot;Gentry in Space&quot; should make Star Wars look like a physics textbook. Jules Verne, John Carter, Buck Rogers...those are are your models along with modern abduction folklore. <br /> <br /> That said, there are always rules, because that's how the Wyrd works. Relativity and gravity might not apply, but of course the red-skinned mineral beings of Mars will free you if you pass trial by combat. Of course the robots will short out if you ask them an impossible question. And so on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T14:15:40-07:00","id":482783,"title":"","content":"I once created a changeling who spent her Durance as a navigational beacon in an asteroid belt. She didn't operate the beacon; she was the beacon. Telluric/(I think)Minstrel cross-kth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}